title: Constitutional Reform
subtitle: Three separate projects, each with its own act.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: parliament_affairs
card-image: img/reichstag_3.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.constitutionCardAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card parliament.constitution_project (technical reference 7.6, 17.10; card catalogue 7.4). Preparing a
// reform takes two main actions: this card prepares the text (1 T); filing the motion waits in the
// agenda. The amendment needs two thirds of the valid votes in the Sejm (quorum 222) and in the Senate
// (quorum 56), and the signatures of at least 111 MPs.
for (var reform of ['democratic_guarantees', 'constructive_vonc', 'presidential_arbitration']) {
    Q['pl_con_' + reform + '_why'] = PolishProjects.constitutionStatus(Q, reform).reason;
}
!}

= Constitutional reform

Each project is a separate alternative with its own act. After its promulgation and one month of implementation it costs 1 B once and changes the rules it names; no declaration alone changes the constitution.

- @democratic_guarantees
- @constructive_vonc
- @presidential_arbitration
- @easy_discard

@democratic_guarantees
title: Democratic guarantees
subtitle: Protection of associations, equal rights and self-government; relations with Wyzwolenie and both minority representations +4; ZLN is against.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.constitutionStatus(Q, 'democratic_guarantees').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_con_democratic_guarantees_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.constitutionChoose(Q, 'democratic_guarantees', 'card');
!}
go-to: result

@constructive_vonc
title: Constructive vote of no confidence
subtitle: Dismissing a cabinet needs 223 votes for an agreed successor at the same time. It protects cabinets PPS does not want too.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.constitutionStatus(Q, 'constructive_vonc').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_con_constructive_vonc_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.constitutionChoose(Q, 'constructive_vonc', 'card');
!}
go-to: result

@presidential_arbitration
title: Presidential arbitration
subtitle: After two failed formations in 3 months the President may dissolve the Sejm; Lewica +8 dissent.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.constitutionStatus(Q, 'presidential_arbitration').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_con_presidential_arbitration_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.constitutionChoose(Q, 'presidential_arbitration', 'card');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Constitutional reform

The text is prepared. Filing the motion — the second main action — waits in the agenda.

- @root: Continue.
